Same directory, same number, same base name as `02.conventions.md` — so
mechanism 1 says these are one article — but a *different* `permalink:`. That
claims two articles in one sidebar slot, and is a hard error (DESIGN.md §6.2).

Copy this into `content/01.Guide/10.Basics/` (dropping `.disabled`) and run
`bb doctor` to see it.
